Id: trip001f
Severity: FAIL
Category: integrity
Check: tripwire_run
Fix: Update the database if the change was expected (tripwire --update); otherwise investigate.
References: tripwire(8)
Controls: NIST SI-7; ISO 8.16

Tripwire reports that a file it is watching has been modified since the
database was last updated. If the change was expected (an upgrade),
update the database; if not, treat it as a possible intrusion.
